NOTE ON BUNDLED ARTWORK

This license covers the code and the original hand-authored SVG artwork
(bundle/, tools/, preview.html, assets/bg-night.svg, assets/bg-day.svg,
assets/mark.svg, assets/mark-day.svg).

It does NOT cover the character illustration assets/yoimiya.jpg and
assets/yoimiya-wide.jpg, which are Genshin Impact character artwork provided
by the user for local personal use only. Those files are excluded from this
repository via .gitignore and must not be redistributed.
